  }, {
    "source" : "好吧!\n",
    "translation" : "Tudo bem!",
    "kind" : "text_bubble",
    "polygon" : [ [ 0.37832895914713544, 0.22813446780285204 ], [ 0.4366847229003906, 0.22813446780285204 ], [ 0.4366847229003906, 0.24554281579442772 ], [ 0.37832895914713544, 0.24554281579442772 ] ]
  }, {
    "source" : "那这个又是怎么回事,嗯?",
    "translation" : "E quanto a isso aqui, hein?",
